## 4. MİMARİ — L0-L6 KATMANLARI

Bağımlılık kuralları: ✅ L6→L5, L5→L4, L4→L3, L3→L2, L2→L1, L1→L0 | ❌ Layer Violation

| Katman | Kapsam | Teknolojiler |
|--------|--------|-------------|
| **L3 Presentation** | Frontend, UI, DOM | Vanilla JS ES6+, ITCSS 9-layer, TrustedTypes |
| **L2 Routing** | SPA router, middleware | PHP 8.4 PageRouter, JS Router.js |
| **L1 Security** | Session, Auth, CSRF, CSP | Middleware pipeline, Argon2id, AES-256-GCM |
| **L0 Infrastructure** | Database, cache, filesystem | PDO MySQL, APCu, Redis |

**Layer Violation İhlali:** Tespit edilirse derhal revert + log CRITICAL.

---

## 5. SİSTEM MİMARİSİ & KODLAMA KILAVUZU

### 5.1 Backend

| Kural | Değer |
|-------|-------|
| Dil | PHP 8.4+ Enterprise |
| Strict Types | `declare(strict_types=1)` her dosyada ZORUNLU |
| Standard | PSR-12 |
| DB | PDO only — ORM yasak (ADR-002) |
| DTO | Data Transfer Object kullanımı zorunlu |
| Validation | Strict input validation, fail-safe security |

### 5.2 Frontend

| Kural | Değer |
|-------|-------|
| Dil | Vanilla JS ES6+ (Framework yasak — ADR-001) |
| Modül | ES Modules, EventBus decoupling |
| Strict Mode | `'use strict'` zorunlu |
| Scope | Global variable yasak, modüler mimari |

### 5.3 CSS

| Kural | Değer |
|-------|-------|
| Metodoloji | ITCSS 9-layer |
| Naming | BEM (Block Element Modifier) |
| Token | CSS custom property zorunlu |
| Responsive | Media queries + CSS variables |
| Device | Behavioral override only |

### 5.4 Güvenlik

| Kural | Değer |
|-------|-------|
| Standard | OWASP Top 10:2025 |
| Encryption | AES-256-GCM, Argon2id |
| CSP | strict-dynamic with nonce |
| CSRF | `csrf_token` (NOT `_csrf_token`) |
| Rate Limiting | APCu, 60 req/60s |

---

## 6. MULTI-DEVICE CONDITIONAL RENDERING (4-Tier)

| Tier | Cihaz | Çözünürlük | Referans |
|------|-------|-----------|----------|
| 1 | 7" Embedded (RPi5) & Tablets | 1024×600 | `.ai/.png/home-1024/` |
| 2 | Desktop & Widescreen | 1920×1080 | `.ai/.png/home-1920/` |
| 3 | 4K & Smart TV | 3840×2160 | Scale engine |
| 4 | Mobile | ≤767px | Compact player |

---

## 7. DİNAMİK ÖLçek MOTORU (ScaleManager.js)

| Prensip | Uygulama |
|---------|----------|
| SRP | Tier resolution, mathematical interpolation, DOM transform ayrımı |
| OCP | Extensible declarative rule registry (`registerTarget`) |
| Dinleyiciler | ResizeObserver, requestAnimationFrame throttle, matchMedia DPR |

